Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:05.48,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Elena Rybakina goes back to back in Ningbo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜连续两年在宁波夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.15,0:00:09.51,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}25{\fs68}日下午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:11.33,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}宁波站女单决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.33,0:00:14.60,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}北京首战出局 武汉因伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:16.06,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}莱巴金娜在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:18.64,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}把去年的冠军守住了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:20.47,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}首轮轮空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:22.23,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}第二轮{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:24.72,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}波利娜 库德梅托娃退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:27.75,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}真正的反复 出现在下一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.88,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}对阵卡瓦 首盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:32.77,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}第二盘却有{\fs78}21{\fs68}次非受迫失误
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.77,0:00:35.90,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}盘点上 莱巴金娜在底线被拉向左侧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:38.91,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}伸拍救球 还是丢掉了这一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.05,0:01:01.03,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Quite extraordinary.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太惊人了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:06.56,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}决胜盘 她的非受迫失误降到两次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:09.38,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}先拿{\fs78}3{\fs68}局 再以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}收尾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:12.48,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}波折还在 主动权拿回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:14.06,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Here's match point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赛点来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.68,0:01:25.60,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Elena Rybakina makes a return to the last four in Ningbo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜再次闯进宁波{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.68,0:01:33.02,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There are certainly a fair few questions around her form.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N围绕她的状态 确实有不少疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.48,0:01:37.60,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That second set, by her standards, was a disappointing one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N按她的标准 第二盘令人失望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.94,0:01:39.32,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She finds it in the end{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但她最终找回了状态
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:43.22,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to move through to a meeting with Diana Shnaider.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N接下来将对阵施耐德
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.06,0:01:45.20,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}6-1 in the third.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N决胜盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.73,0:01:49.39,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}半决赛 首盘的终点 一次次被推远
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.39,0:01:51.33,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}前{\fs78}10{\fs68}个盘点都没拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.33,0:01:53.77,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}莱巴金娜等到了第{\fs78}11{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:58.21,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's just extraordinary, really, because{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这真的太不可思议了 因为
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.41,0:02:10.69,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}she got there in the end.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她终于拿下了这一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:14.49,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Eleven set points required in that final game{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最后这一局用了{\fs78}11{\fs68}个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.49,0:02:16.69,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to eventually get over the line.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N才终于赢下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.77,0:02:20.25,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It made that first set a lot tougher than it might have been.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这让首盘比原本可能的局面艰难得多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:21.72,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:23.51,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}轮到自己发球结束比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.51,0:02:26.39,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}她却连丢四分 被追到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.39,0:02:29.91,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}但她随即破发 又把机会争了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:46.58,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The world number one is back in the final in Ningbo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}再次闯进宁波决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:50.06,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The defense of her title continues.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的卫冕之路还在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:53.52,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}An impressive week from Diana Shnaider,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N施耐德这一周表现出色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:55.92,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}who has a great record here as well,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她在这里也有很好的战绩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:58.74,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but she just couldn't get it over the line today{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但今天她没能赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.74,0:03:00.89,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}against the best player in the world.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她面对的是世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.57,0:03:07.07,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Had a few struggles at the back end of both sets, Elena Rybakina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜在两盘收尾时都有些波折
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.41,0:03:10.67,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Scoreline maybe making it look a little{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比分看上去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:12.51,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}more comfortable than it actually was.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N或许比实际过程更轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:16.91,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Through to the final, 6-3, 7-5.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N闯进决赛 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.68,0:03:20.13,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}决赛 对面是费尔南德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:21.38,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}首盘盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.38,0:03:24.06,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}莱巴金娜发球后继续在底线相持
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.06,0:03:26.04,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}调动对手左右奔跑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:29.01,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}赢下这一分 她就先拿一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.43,0:03:32.90,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Right at the start of the match, she wasn't able to take them.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N开场时 她没抓住那些机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:34.54,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Since then it's been comfortable.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N此后 局面就轻松多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:46.66,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Too good from the world number one,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}的表现太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:49.00,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}wrapping up the set in style.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮地拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:52.92,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}这一晚 她的{\fs78}8{\fs68}个发球局全部保住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:55.46,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}费尔南德斯{\fs78}4{\fs68}次拿到破发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:59.77,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}次都没能突破 冠军 就在眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.61,0:04:13.29,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Elena Rybakina goes back to back in Ningbo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜连续两年在宁波夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.19,0:04:17.71,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another statement from the world number one,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}再次证明了自己
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.99,0:04:21.01,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and she claims yet another title{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她又拿下一座冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:23.59,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in what has been an extraordinary season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N为这个非凡的赛季再添一笔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:29.73,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Very little drama, very little jeopardy{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N几乎没有悬念 也没有险情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:34.02,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in a clash against a player who's had an outstanding week,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N尽管对手这一周的表现非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:39.78,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but the best player in the world was just too good on the night.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}今晚的发挥实在太强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:43.30,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Elena Rybakina, the champion in Ningbo once again,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜再次成为宁波冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:47.30,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}winning this final against Leylah Fernandez, 6-2, 6-2.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N决赛以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}击败费尔南德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:49.15,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}制胜分{\fs78}25{\fs68}比{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.15,0:04:52.06,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}非受迫失误{\fs78}25{\fs68}比{\fs78}24{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.90,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她拿下对手{\fs78}4{\fs68}个发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:57.26,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}也把自己的发球局 一个都守住了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:05:01.10,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Thank you so much for an amazing atmosphere every day.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢谢大家每天营造这么棒的氛围
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:04.82,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's amazing to play in front of you,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N能在你们面前打球 感觉特别好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:06.50,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}always gives a lot of motivation,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N总能给我很多动力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:09.16,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}a lot of energy to keep on playing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N给我继续比赛的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:12.08,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it's already a second year here, second win,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我第{\fs78}2{\fs68}年来这里 第{\fs78}2{\fs68}次夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:14.06,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and it's such a special place for me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这里对我来说很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:16.18,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Thank you so much, Ningbo. Xie xie!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N非常感谢 宁波！谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:20.29,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}从中途失速 到收官反复
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.29,0:05:23.22,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}莱巴金娜还是把宁波冠军留下了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.22,0:05:26.34,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}赛季第四冠 生涯第{\fs78}15{\fs68}冠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:28.01,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}到了年终总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:30.40,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}你看好她走到哪一步？
